            ]
          },
          "722391003": {
            "id": "722391003",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe we could try taking this to the various shops we've been to — you know, like With Wind Comes Glory in Mondstadt, Xigu Antiques in Liyue, and Netsuke no Gen Crafts in Inazuma. They'll know more about this stuff.",
